# Run 407 evidence archive — only README.md, summary.txt, and .gitignore are tracked.
# All per-run artifacts contain absolute paths and ephemeral data and MUST NOT be committed.
# Only publish-safe document/schema hashes and OK/POSITIVE status lines appear in the tracked summary.
# The full-tree manifest, the Markdown and JSON anchor-drift reports, and the CI summary are
# generated transiently OUTSIDE the package tree (runner temp / staging) and are never committed.
material/
node/
nodes/
logs/
data/
run406/
artifact-staging/
*.err
*.log
*.out
*.help.txt
*.usage.txt
*.kem.sk.bin
*.cert.bin
*.key
*.pem
*.public.json
*.candidate.json
metrics*.txt
disk_files.txt
workflow.lf.yml
workflow.nocomment.yml
run406.log
*.generated.json
PACKAGE_INTEGRITY_FULL_TREE_MANIFEST.generated.json
ANCHOR_DRIFT_REPORT.md
ANCHOR_DRIFT_REPORT.json
PACKAGE_INTEGRITY_CI_SUMMARY.txt
